# 04-delivery/

Active delivery memory for `{{PROJECT_TITLE}}`.

## Structured source files

| File                  | Purpose                              |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------------ |
| `sprint-planning.yml` | Source of truth for sprint planning  |
| `feature-implementations.yml` | Source of truth for BA / DEV / Delivery implementation tracks |

## Subfolders

| Folder              | Purpose                                                    |
| ------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------- |
| `tasks/`            | One file per active task (template: `task-template.md`)    |
| `sprints/`          | One folder per sprint                                      |
| `session-handoffs/` | `latest-session.md` + per-sprint archives                  |
| `exec-plans/`       | `active/` and `completed/` execution plans                 |
| `functional-specs/` | Active specifications and immutable frozen baselines        |
| `implementation-notes/` | Running implementation evidence and test outputs       |
| `track-handoffs/`   | Governed BA→DEV and DEV→Delivery handoffs                  |

## Main documents

| File                          | Purpose                       |
| ----------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| `01-implementation-notes.md`  | Free-form implementation notes|
| `02-change-log.md`            | User-facing change log        |
| `03-defect-log.md`            | Defects raised and resolved   |
| `04-delivery-evidence.md`     | Test results, demo evidence   |
